+1. **Set the evidence boundary first**: use metadata and synthetic records by default, and obtain explicit approval before inspecting live personal data or involving an external processor. Then map the data: discover and classify personal data across every store (including logs, caches, indexes, third parties), producing the field → location → purpose → basis → retention → delete-path data map.
